### Feature Learner — UPDATE (PUT) / UPDATE (PATCH)
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 1

# @name updateLearnerPut
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/aprendices/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Pérez Actualizada",
  "description": "Aprendiz actualizado de CampusNube",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "status": "active"
}

###

# @name updateLearnerPatch
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/aprendices/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Descripción actualizada parcialmente"
}
